### Define agencyAuth in your HTTP client environment as the base64-encoded
### "username:password" for the configured API_USERNAME and API_PASSWORD.

### 1. List projects (requires agency authentication)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Authorization: Basic {{agencyAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. Pause a project (requires agency authentication)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/pause
Authorization: Basic {{agencyAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Pause a milestone (requires agency authentication; expect 404 if absent)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/milestones/pause
Authorization: Basic {{agencyAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "milestoneId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "reason": "Waiting for client deliverables"
}

### 4. Submit a public one-time magic-link review (expect 404 if absent)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/reviews/33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "feedback": "The milestone is approved. Thank you."
}

### 5. Invalid pause request (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/milestones/pause
Authorization: Basic {{agencyAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "milestoneId": "not-a-uuid",
  "reason": ""
}